('35e1a-ge-en-ellipsis-06','en-ellipsis','en','Is this seat free? It looks like it.','这个座位空着吗？看起来是的。','语境中的省略回应；新增正式例句覆盖：natural daily-life context。',NULL,'[]',NULL,'6'),
('35e1a-ge-en-may-01','en-may','en','The train may arrive a few minutes late.','火车可能会晚到几分钟。','表达不确定性；新增正式例句覆盖：canonical/basic usage。',NULL,'[]',NULL,'1'),
