('35e1a-ge-en-may-03','en-may','en','The manager may join us later.','经理稍后可能会加入我们。','表达不确定性；新增正式例句覆盖：natural daily-life context。',NULL,'[]',NULL,'3'),
('35e1a-ge-en-may-04','en-may','en','We may need to change the schedule.','我们可能需要更改日程。','表达不确定性；新增正式例句覆盖：natural daily-life context。',NULL,'[]',NULL,'4'),
